      <title>FairVPN, overlay topology construction tool to maximize TCP fairness</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>New challenges in Virtualization devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;FairVPN is a python wrapper for tinc-vpn to create overlay VPN networks scalable to many nodes, maximizing TCP fairness among all connections in the network with minimal control traffic and memory usage.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
